---
title: Master Decision Flowchart
---
flowchart TD
    A["What is your\noutcome type?"] -->|"Continuous"| B["How many\ngroups?"]
    A -->|"Categorical"| C["Chi-square or\nFisher's exact"]
    B -->|"1 group"| D["One-sample\nt-test"]
    B -->|"2 groups"| E["Paired or\nindependent?"]
    B -->|"3+ groups"| F["ANOVA or\nKruskal-Wallis"]
    E -->|"Independent"| G["Normal\ndata?"]
    E -->|"Paired"| H["Normal\ndata?"]
    G -->|"Yes"| I["Two-sample\nt-test"]
    G -->|"No"| J["Mann-Whitney\nU test"]
    H -->|"Yes"| K["Paired\nt-test"]
    H -->|"No"| L["Wilcoxon\nsigned-rank"]
